        <li><a href="https://www.archives.gov/milestone-documents/declaration-of-independence" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">U.S. National Archives — Declaration of Independence (1776)</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.archives.gov/founding-docs/downloads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">U.S. National Archives — High-resolution founding document images and reuse information</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.archives.gov/milestone-documents/bill-of-rights" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">U.S. National Archives — Bill of Rights (1791)</a></li>
      </ul>
